<h2>6. Security & Verification Metrics</h2>
<ul>
    <li><strong>Foundry Unit & Fuzz Tests:</strong> 257 / 257 tests passing across 19 test suites (<code>contracts/test/</code>).</li>
    <li><strong>Secret Box Security & Penetration Suite:</strong> 40 / 40 dedicated security tests passing across 6 domains.</li>
    <li><strong>RFC-6238 TOTP Engine Suite:</strong> 8 / 8 tests passing verifying Base32 decoding, HMAC-SHA1 dynamic truncation, and zero-disk/network isolation.</li>
    <li><strong>Slither Static Analysis (v0.11.6):</strong> 0 Critical, 0 High, 0 Medium vulnerabilities across 55 contracts.</li>
    <li><strong>Notification Security Regression Suite:</strong> 11 / 11 suites passing covering rate limiting, timing-safe auth, XSS, and payload schemas.</li>
    <li><strong>Frontend TypeScript & ESLint:</strong> Strict compilation, 0 errors, 0 warnings across all 108 source files.</li>
    <li><strong>Dependencies:</strong> 0 vulnerabilities on npm audit.</li>
    <li><strong>Terminology Compliance:</strong> 0 instances of "staking"; strictly lending.</li>
</ul>

